<view class="wrap">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="logo">遇</view>
    <view class="title">知遇</view>
    <view class="sub">先深聊五个维度，再决定要不要认识</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="avatar-row" bindtap="chooseAvatar">
      <image wx:if="{{avatarPath}}" class="avatar" src="{{avatarPath}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
      <view wx:else class="avatar ph">＋</view>
      <view class="avatar-tip">{{avatarPath ? '点击更换头像' : '上传头像（可选）'}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">昵称</view>
      <input class="input" value="{{nick}}" bindinput="onNick" placeholder="最多 12 个字" maxlength="12" />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">性别</view>
      <view class="seg">
        <view class="seg-item {{gender === 'f' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-g="f" bindtap="onGender">女</view>
        <view class="seg-item {{gender === 'm' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-g="m" bindtap="onGender">男</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">出生年</view>
      <picker mode="date" fields="year" start="{{minBirth}}" end="{{maxBirth}}" value="{{birthValue}}" bindchange="onBirth">
        <view class="picker">{{birthYear ? birthYear + ' 年 · ' + age + ' 岁' : '请选择'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">所在城市</view>
      <picker range="{{cities}}" value="{{cityIndex}}" bindchange="onCity">
        <view class="picker">{{cities[cityIndex]}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">手机号 <text class="opt">选填</text></view>
      <input class="input" type="number" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhone" placeholder="仅记录在本机，不发短信" maxlength="11" />
    </view>

    <button class="btn block" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{submitting}}">进入知遇</button>
    <view class="login-note">登录即表示你了解：本演示不收集真实身份信息</view>
  </view>

  <view class="notes">
    <view class="note-t">这是本地演示版，先把话说清楚</view>
    <view class="note"><text class="dot"></text>资料只存在这台手机上，不上传任何服务器</view>
    <view class="note"><text class="dot"></text>手机号只做格式记录，不发短信、不做核验</view>
    <view class="note"><text class="dot"></text>未做实名认证与人脸核身，换设备就等于换账号</view>
    <view class="note"><text class="dot"></text>真实上线的婚恋类小程序需企业主体 + 类目许可</view>
  </view>
</view>
